# hauler_crew.layout — Merchant hauler capture deck
#   Facing:            bow RIGHT (cockpit with ship console C), engines PORT
#   Center:            spine hall on the true midpoint row, split fore/aft
#   Holds:             container-maze cargo bays above + below the spine
#   Aft:               twin engine rooms + two-hatch airlock to the exterior
#   Bottom left:       enclosed breach stub (b) — spawn at P, exit > inside
#   Content:           merchant crew via role tokens (doc 48 SETTLED 28) —
#                      honest Merchants + security droids (the wealth dial);
#                      cargo_bay / personal_storage / engine_room /
#                      mess_hall loot
